<!--Custom AI by jusk - F1 1969 Season 

The carset includes 26 slots, but I recommend using 18 AI opponents for most races (i.e. including only regular runners from the '69 season), and taking one of other/optional cars for yourself. Optional exta drivers are also included to make up a full grid as required. These can be activated by removing the comment tags around the relevant drivers. Recommended extras:
- Kyalami: 19 opponents (Add De Klerk)
- Silverstone 19 opponents (Add Bell)
- Nordschleife 22 opponents (Add Attwood, Mitter, Pescarolo and Cevert)
- Watkins Glen 20 opponents (add Lovely and Eaton)
Or add them all and run with 26 if you want to!

Changelog v0.1:
- Initial version to match Alain Fry's skinpack

***  1969 Season Calendar  ***
#	Track				Date			AMS2 Track
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
1 	South African GP		01 Mar			Kyalami Historic 1976
2 	Spanish GP			04 May
3 	Monaco GP			18 May			Azure Circuit			
